# ANCHORED to the repo root on purpose.  A bare `data/` matches a directory of
# that name at ANY depth, which silently excluded
# third_party/ProGAP/core/data/ -- the package holding NodeDataLoader and the
# BoundOutDegree / filter_class / remove_isolated_nodes / remove_self_loops
# transforms.  ProGAP could not be imported from a clone, and the source that
# produced its published numbers was never in version control.  Keep the
# leading slash: it still ignores the ~4.4 GB dataset cache at ./data.
/data/
/tmp/

